   "attributes": {
    "biography": {
     "en": "CLAMP is a four-woman manga studio formed from the remaining members of the CLAMP doujinshi circle.\n\n- [Ohkawa Ageha](https://mangadex.org/author/937ca459-3e37-450f-9114-ef81a37e335f/ohkawa-ageha) (leader; story \u0026 script)\n- [Apapa Mokona](https://mangadex.org/author/259db6b3-3c79-4bbc-82f4-b65dde73e904/apapa-mokona) (lead artist; colorist)\n- [Nekoi Tsubaki](https://mangadex.org/author/3dffe29e-f96d-446b-a288-84120d4f1297/nekoi-tsubaki) (art assistant; chibi artist)\n- [Igarashi Satsuki](https://mangadex.org/author/93512b92-b84c-44df-8cfc-47182f6dcb98/igarashi-satsuki) (design; art assistant)\n\nFormer Members:\n[O-Kyon](https://mangadex.org/author/3fbb331e-31a0-4547-9939-ffb92a1a613f/o-kyon)\n[Nanao Sei](https://mangadex.org/author/db81cfe8-8d99-4e0f-a463-de44486ca9c6/nanao-sei)\n[Akiyama Tamayo](https://mangadex.org/author/e945c2df-7420-42e3-a106-e05b8475aeee/akiyama-tamayo)\n[Sei Leeza](https://mangadex.org/author/9dd0940d-4a6d-4f6e-80bf-6884c0b8a64c/sei-leeza)\n [Hisagi Soshi](https://mangadex.org/author/c639e261-eb62-4311-a6f1-c798f450c6ff/hisagi-soshi)\n[Nakamori Kazue](https://mangadex.org/author/178b68e6-668d-4a47-aa7f-44ff95905c4c/nakamori-kazue)\n[Ohmi Shinya](https://mangadex.org/author/4019fdb4-7807-49d3-a10a-f900ec428ce6/ohmi-shinya)"
